    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Devilish Lady Doctor - A Night of Domination and Seduction -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run and hide to survive from insane beauties trying to rape you!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384860/extras/132560dca20836a196da33593509e584.avif?t=1737874254\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Silent Night in a Remote Mountain Hospital</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were supposed to be leading a peaceful life as an inpatient there\u2026 or so you thought. When you awaken, the hospital is shrouded in an eerie atmosphere, with no trace of its once tranquil nature.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384860/extras/0815b40885af61715b626579ef8724aa.avif?t=1737874254\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you try to leave your empty hospital room, strange phenomena begin to unfold one after another. Waiting for you in the depths of this twisted place are the &quot;Mad Demons&quot;\u2014a doctor and nurses who have descended into madness. They smile seductively, attempting to ensnare you in their grasp...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384860/extras/bed100f76fd807b7dcc3621a457ebe60.avif?t=1737874254\" width=800 height=600 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384860/extras/a97883e61c1a3223a6c6dbfd896ec59d.avif?t=1737874254\" width=800 height=600 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384860/extras/5e1451ce10f434811f7692f9dbb3cf6f.avif?t=1737874254\" width=800 height=600 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384860/extras/7f808f4cf80f0c00488464e7250abb0d.avif?t=1737874254\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Run&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run in cardinal directions with WASD (\u2191\u2190\u2193\u2192) and change your front direction with the mouse. The women will stop chasing after a certain period, so keep running at first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Crouch&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the SHIFT key to crouch. This will narrow the detection range of the enemies and also recover damage. Crouch and hide in the shadows. Turn off your flashlight as it will be detected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hide&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hide in closets inside the dungeon (long press left-click in front of them).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Throw&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus the center dot in the center on the screen and left-click to pick up objects like jars and throw them at the women to stun them.\u00a0 Use the sound to your strategic advantage, as women will react to it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Pushed Down</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mash the &quot;W (\u2191)&quot; button to break free! If you accumulate a certain amount of damage, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a game over, pressing &quot;CountDown = C key&quot; will start an ejaculation countdown, and pressing &quot;VoicePlay = V key&quot; will make the girl start talking dirty to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When in first-person view, you can zoom in and out with the mouse scroll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuri</strong> (Voiced by: Amana Himemiya)\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384860/extras/035c7a6f3f840fc5f21e0e84f489a4f1.avif?t=1737874254\" width=800 height=796 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A doctor who masks her cruelty with a facade of kindness. In the dream world, she transforms into a cold-hearted demon, relentlessly pursuing the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Renka</strong> (Voiced by: Airi Himekawa)\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384860/extras/49cd65f35c0ee7983858571767b28b06.avif?t=1737874254\" data-has-big width=800 height=728 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nurse with a flashy, &quot;gal&quot; style. As a mad demon, she becomes intensely sadistic, mercilessly cornering the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suel</strong>\u00a0(Voiced by: Amana Himemiya)\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384860/extras/a2cff3d308d4a4f19bc50a413eddd2f0.avif?t=1737874254\" width=800 height=796 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nurse who came to the hospital as a trainee from overseas. However, she harbors a hidden secret of her own\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get\u00a0raped with over 10 sexual attacks including getting spit and peed on ...</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384860/extras/13f36e610f8f41951cf6f013b0a060d8.avif?t=1737874254\" data-has-big width=800 height=612 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
